ws333 p027, test only (kbuild.sh applies it for the build and takes it off after): the next S0 idle is woken by
the CMOS RTC alarm (seconds now + 40, minutes and hours do not care; RTC_EN through the ACPI fixed event), and the
TCO watchdog keeps counting through the sleep, so a 5330 sleep that never ends resets the machine back to Debian.
